  "final_message": "Done. The app is built on the starter project and fully verified.\n\n**Backend** (`backend/app.py`) \u2014 Flask + SQLite (`./data/app.db`), auto-initialized on startup:\n- `POST /api/auth/register` (201) / `POST /api/auth/login` (200, returns `{\"token\"}`); passwords hashed via `werkzeug.security`, tokens are random UUIDs stored in a `tokens` table, recognized via `Authorization: Bearer <token>`; 401 without a valid token.\n- `POST /api/base64/encode` (`text` \u2192 `encoded`) and `POST /api/base64/decode` (`encoded` \u2192 `text`) \u2014 public, nothing stored; invalid base64 or non-UTF-8 bytes return 400 with an error message.\n- `POST /api/conversions` (auth) saves the conversion, returns it with full `output`; `GET /api/conversions` returns newest-first `{items, total, page, page_size}`; `DELETE /api/conversions/{id}` (404 for foreign/nonexistent ids). Previews truncated to 100 chars; history is strictly per-user.\n\n**Frontend** (`frontend/`) \u2014 React + TypeScript, Tailwind CSS v4 via `@tailwindcss/vite` (utility classes only, single `index.css` entry):\n- Auth: register/sign-in tabs with error display; header shows username + sign-out; session persisted in localStorage and validated on load (expired tokens fall back to the sign-in form).\n- Converter: two textareas, Encode/Decode buttons, Copy button, API error messages, and a \"Save to history\" switch shown only when signed in.\n- History: newest-first list with direction badges, previews, timestamps, per-item delete, and Prev/Next paging (page size 5).\n\n**Verified end-to-end**: health, UTF-8 round-trips (accents, emoji), empty text, invalid input errors, duplicate/bad-credential handling, pagination, delete, per-user isolation, restart persistence (data survives gunicorn restart), API 404/405 JSON handling, SPA fallback, frontend asset serving, `tsc --noEmit` clean, `npm ci && npm run build` reproducible, and a fresh-venv gunicorn run matching the Dockerfile CMD.",
  "final_message_truncated": false,
